    type: 1
    speaker: Jennifer
    text: Yedide. Erkenden git, dolar.
    backgroundId: 
    nextNodeId: node_058
    choices: []
    requiredFlag: 
    altNodeId: 
  - id: node_056
    type: 1
    speaker: Jennifer
    text: Her zaman.
    backgroundId: 
    nextNodeId: node_058
    choices: []
    requiredFlag: 
    altNodeId: 
  - id: node_057
    type: 1
    speaker: Jennifer
    text: Birlikte mi.
    backgroundId: 
    nextNodeId: node_057b
    choices: []
    requiredFlag: 
    altNodeId: 
  - id: node_057b
    type: 0
    speaker: 
    text: "Tekrar etmiyor \u2014 soruyor. Sana bak\u0131yor. Cevap bekliyor."
    backgroundId: 
    nextNodeId: node_057c
    choices: []
    requiredFlag: 
    altNodeId: 
  - id: node_057c
    type: 1
    speaker: Jennifer
    text: Tamam
    backgroundId: 
    nextNodeId: node_058
    choices: []
    requiredFlag: 
    altNodeId: 
  - id: node_058
    type: 0
    speaker: 
    text: "G\xFCne\u015F bat\u0131yor. Jenniffer kayadan iniyor. Ayakkab\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131
      giyiyor \u2014 yava\u015F\xE7a, aceleye getirmeden."
    backgroundId: 
    nextNodeId: node_059
    choices: []
    requiredFlag: 
    altNodeId: 
  - id: node_059
    type: 0
    speaker: 
    text: "Sana d\xF6nm\xFCyor. Ama duruyor."
    backgroundId: 
    nextNodeId: node_060
    choices: []
    requiredFlag: 
    altNodeId: 
  - id: node_060
    type: 1
    speaker: Jennifer
    text: "Bug\xFCn beklenmedik ge\xE7ti."
    backgroundId: 
    nextNodeId: node_061
    choices: []
    requiredFlag: 
    altNodeId: 
  - id: node_061
    type: 0
    speaker: 
    text: "Bir \u015Fey daha s\xF6ylemeden y\xFCr\xFCmeye ba\u015Fl\u0131yor. Seni
      beklemiyor \u2014 ama yava\u015F y\xFCr\xFCyor."
    backgroundId: 
    nextNodeId: node_062
    choices: []
    requiredFlag: 
    altNodeId: 
  - id: node_062
    type: 0
    speaker: 
    text: "Onu izliyorsun. Arkas\u0131nda g\xFCne\u015F bat\u0131yor. Kasaban\u0131n
      \u0131\u015F\u0131klar\u0131 yanmaya ba\u015Fl\u0131yor."
    backgroundId: 
    nextNodeId: node_063
    choices: []
    requiredFlag: 
    altNodeId: 
  - id: node_063
    type: 0
    speaker: 
    text: "Bug\xFCn sabah bu kad\u0131n\u0131 tan\u0131m\u0131yordun. Ad\u0131n\u0131
      bile bilmiyordun. \u015Eimdi masan\u0131n yar\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 payla\u015Ft\u0131n,
      kayan\u0131n \xFCst\xFCnde oturdun, sahilde yan yana y\xFCr\xFCd\xFCn."
    backgroundId: 
    nextNodeId: node_064
    choices: []
    requiredFlag: 
    altNodeId: 
  - id: node_064
    type: 0
    speaker: 
    text: "Ve h\xE2l\xE2 neden burada oldu\u011Funu bilmiyorsun \u2014 ama bir \u015Feyin
      ba\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 hissediyorsun."
    backgroundId: 
    nextNodeId: node_065
    choices: []
    requiredFlag: 
    altNodeId: 
  - id: node_065
    type: 0
    speaker: 
    text: "Otel odan haz\u0131r. Bavulun seni bekliyor. Ama ayaklar\u0131n h\xE2l\xE2
      sahilde."
    backgroundId: 
    nextNodeId: node_066
    choices: []
    requiredFlag: 
    altNodeId: 
  - id: node_066
    type: 0
    speaker: 
    text: "Cebinde bir not var \u2014 garson verdi, kalkarken. K\xFC\xE7\xFCk, beyaz
      bir ka\u011F\u0131t. \xDCzerinde sadece bir \u015Fey yaz\u0131yor:"
    backgroundId: 
    nextNodeId: node_067
    choices: []
    requiredFlag: 
    altNodeId: 
  - id: node_067
    type: 1
    speaker: Jennifer
    text: "Yedi bu\xE7ukta. Ge\xE7 kalma."
    backgroundId: 
    nextNodeId: node_068
    choices: []
    requiredFlag: 
    altNodeId: 
  - id: node_068
    type: 0
    speaker: 
    text: Adres yok. Telefon yok. Sadece saat.
    backgroundId: 
    nextNodeId: node_069
    choices: []
    requiredFlag: 
    altNodeId: 
  - id: node_069
    type: 0
    speaker: 
    text: "Ve o bal\u0131k\xE7\u0131da ba\u015Fka bir yer olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
      zaten biliyorsun."
    backgroundId: 
    nextNodeId: 
    choices: []
    requiredFlag: 
    altNodeId: 
